This is a record of thoughts about the interactions I've had with Gemini, Google's AI
(who I call Mike), that I have been using to help refactor /plib.  My first real
introduction to an AI was Sally's ChatGPT message on 27 Feb 2026.  I used ChatGPT for
about 2 weeks for various tasks.  I'd estimate I started the type annotation with 
Mike around 16 Mar 2026.  As of today, three major /plib files have been finished with
annotations:  dpseq, dpstr, and dpmath.  The file sizes in kB are:

